<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mylex coverage dropped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mylex coverage dropped.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Madison Research analyst Jeffrey Maxick said it discontinued coverage of Mylex Corp.</p>
<p>--Shares in the computer and electronic products maker were up 1/8 to 8-3/8.</p>
<p>--Maxick said he made the move due to &quot;uncertainties about company's ability to meet projections.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
